# EmailJS Credentials — Contact Form
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Sign up FREE at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Create a new "Email Service" (Gmail recommended)
# 3. Create a new "Email Template" with these variables:
#      {{name}}, {{email}}, {{message}}
#    Set "Reply To" to {{email}} so you can reply directly
# 4. Copy your credentials below
# 5. Rename this file to .env and fill in your values
# 6. NEVER commit .env to git (already in .gitignore)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
